Sweep includes code vendored or adapted from L1vsun/JEV-Trading-BOT
(https://github.com/L1vsun/JEV-Trading-BOT):

  sweep/typesafe.py          vendored verbatim (jev_bot/typesafe.py)
  sweep/decide.py            mechanism adapted (jev_bot/decide.py): composite
                             scoring, confidence-gated sizing, self-consistency
  sweep/surrogate.py         pattern adapted (jev_bot/surrogate.py)
  sweep/cli.py               scaffolding adapted (jev_bot/cli.py): --model,
                             --cache, --replay-cache, models, ask
  sweep/replay.py            shell adapted (jev_bot/replay.py): self-contained
                             HTML replay with embedded JSON

The reference project's quant code (order-flow imbalance, VPIN, Kyle's lambda,
RLS fair value, simulator) is not used anywhere in Sweep.

